#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1121-A expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "CL-D / §9 Q2 (wave TA-4): AGE is Permissible in SENDIG DM, and before the Requirements.Variables gate the Java engine read the absent column as empty - empty(AGE) held on every row, flooding a dataset for omitting a column it was allowed to omit. With the gate the engine records one auditable skip instead. AGETXT's absence stays handled inside the Check by its bare empty(AGETXT) leaf, which is TRUE on an absent column (absent = all-missing, EC-43); Plan B phase 4d' deleted the redundant not var_exists alternative that used to carry it, leaving the verdict unchanged."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ARMCD   type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
---
S1 | DM | S1-001 | TRT01
